    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chaos Machina is a fast-paced action roguelike designed for immersive, bite-sized runs. Enter the flow state as you weave with your robot through enemy fire. Unleash powerful upgrades, and master 10-minute bursts of adrenaline before the Chaos reclaims the map.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into generated dungeons and fight robots corrupted by Chaos AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal as much damage as possible through your robot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to  dodge all the enemy attacks ahead of you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible against 13 enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 15 different abilities to clear the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0 wasting of your time, each run should take no more than 10 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 135 upgrades for your abilities to find your own way </p></li></ul>",
